ADDRESS: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:SpecialPages
==================================================
This page contains a list of  [LINK: (special pages) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Help:Special_page] . Most of the content of these pages is automatically generated and cannot be edited. To suggest a change to the parts that can be edited, find the appropriate text on  [LINK: (Special:AllMessages) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:AllMessages]  and then request your change on the talk page of the message (using {{ [LINK: (editprotected) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Template:Edit_fully-protected] }} to draw the attention of administrators).

You can also see what message names are used on a page by adding ?uselang=qqx to the end of its URL, e.g.  [LINK: (https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:SpecialPages?uselang=qqx) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:SpecialPages?uselang=qqx]  will show (specialpages-summary) in place of this message, which allows you to find  [LINK: (MediaWiki:Specialpages-summary) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/MediaWiki:Specialpages-summary] .

For an index of special pages, see  [LINK: (Help:SpecialPages) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Help:SpecialPages#Alphabetical_order] .


